<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - Shoe Rack</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .about-section {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about-section h1 {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .about-section p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .about-section img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .team-section {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 40px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .team-section h2 {
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #333;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .team-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .team-member {
            text-align: center;
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 30%;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background-color: #fff;
        }

        .team-member img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 150px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .team-member h3 {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #333;
        }

        .team-member p {
            color: #777;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('../partials/userHeader') %>
        <p class="fw-bold text-dark fs-5 mt-4 ms-3">Home > <span class="text-warning fs-5"> About</span></p>

        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-section">
                <h1>About Shoe Rack</h1>
                <p>Welcome to Shoe Rack, your number one source for all things footwear. We're dedicated to providing
                    you with the best shoes, with a focus on quality, customer service, and uniqueness.</p>
                <p>Founded in 2024, Shoe Rack has come a long way from its beginnings. We now serve customers all over
                    the world and are thrilled to be a part of the fair trade wing of the fashion industry.</p>
                <p>We hope you enjoy our products as much as we enjoy offering them to you. If you have any questions or
                    comments, please don't hesitate to contact us.</p>
                <img src="https://i0.wp.com/picjumbo.com/wp-content/uploads/bumps-yellow-sidewalk-road-marking-free-photo.jpg?w=600&quality=80" alt="Banner 1">
            </div>

            <div class="team-section">
                <h2>Meet Our Team</h2>
                <div class="team-container">
                    <div class="team-member">
                        <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQSU1SYfuEy_PHvWze-NB7S0Ruwv16xA1edMg&s" alt="Team Member 1">
                        <h3>Neymar Jr</h3>
                        <p>Founder & CEO</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="team-member">
                        <img src="https://i.pinimg.com/originals/b4/58/19/b4581953196352a07103703d1c79aada.jpg" alt="Team Member 2">
                        <h3>Cristiano</h3>
                        <p>Chief Marketing Officer</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="team-member">
                        <img src="https://i.pinimg.com/originals/81/6c/62/816c627333273be5a5eb66880f980b85.jpg" alt="Team Member 3">
                        <h3>Messi</h3>
                        <p>Head of Sales</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <%- include('../partials/userfooter') %>
</body>

</html>